      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "The Polar Express bridges classic Christmas fantasies like <a href=\"/movie/13764\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"13764\">Santa Claus: The Movie</a> (1985) with modern technical spectacles. Its dream-like train sequences influenced everything from <a href=\"/movie/44826\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"44826\">Hugo</a> (2011) to <a href=\"/movie/110415\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"110415\">Snowpiercer</a> (2013). The film's surreal tone and questioning of belief systems created a template for sophisticated children's entertainment that <a href=\"/movie/411\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"411\">The Chronicles of Narnia: The Lion, the Witch and the Wardrobe</a> (2005) and <a href=\"/movie/1265\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"1265\">Bridge to Terabithia</a> (2007) would later follow."
      }
